# Normalise line endings to LF.
#
# The whole index is already LF, so this changes nothing today. It exists to
# keep that true on a machine with core.autocrlf=true, where a fresh clone would
# otherwise check out CRLF.
#
# That matters beyond taste because of src/app/brand.css: it is a mirror of
# web/app/brand.css in the Percentile repository, and the two are kept in sync
# by being byte-identical. Percentile pins LF in its own .gitattributes. Without
# this file the same content would differ by one byte per line on Windows, and
# the drift check that is the entire justification for copying rather than
# packaging would report a difference on every line while nothing had drifted.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
